From d0934e4f84fc16e80714110dd9ed2d14227e04f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:58:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-66: a .csv tab from before the update -> the table
 is one click away (0.66.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun (IO_Table.csv shown as text): "依照圖片 表格沒有出現阿 我已經有更新過". 0.65.0 was
running (the exthost log: activated 11:49:58, the table icon in the title bar),
but VS Code keeps the kind of editor a tab had: Mot_Table.csv / IO_Table.csv
were open as text before the reload and came back as text.
- a .csv shown as text: 「⊞ 用表格開啟」 in the status bar and one question per
  file (not for one opened as text from the table on purpose)
- 用表格開啟 opens the table and closes the text tab of the same file (the same
  document: nothing unsaved is lost)
- the 頁面 list reveals the current page after the list has drawn the new items
  (the exthost log had "No tree item with id '1/q3:page:...'" and "Data tree
  node not found: 1/grp:web 根目錄")

Tests (all 4 layers pass: lib 147, smoke 150, real VS Code 138): smoke (the
button, one question, the table opened), real VS Code (a copy of
Mot_Table.csv opened with vscode.open = the table; a text tab of it: the
button shows, it opens the table, the text tab is gone).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
